.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-MEMORY 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-memory \- Read, export, receipt or commit versioned file memory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu memory\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read, export, receipt or commit versioned file memory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-memory\-read(1)
Read a versioned memory file for an owner
.TP
quipu\-memory\-export(1)
Export an owner\*(Aqs memory files as a file\-data envelope
.TP
quipu\-memory\-receipt(1)
Compute the receipt a memory commit request would produce
.TP
quipu\-memory\-commit(1)
Commit a versioned memory file change
.TP
quipu\-memory\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
